   "type": "Collection",
   "id": "mro_ctx_controlled_usgs_dtms",
   "stac_version": "1.0.0",
   "description": "These data are Ames Stereo Pipeline generate MRO CTX DTMs. Data are generated from relatively controlled CTX data and are then absolutely controlled to MOLA using the ASP `pc_align` application. Therefore, these data are absolutely controlled to MOLA. Data are projected to the appropriate IAU Well-known Text v2 (WKT2) represented projection. For documentation and to discuss these data see [our documentation pages](https://stac.astrogeology.usgs.gov/docs/data/mars/ctxdtms/).\nNote: Some DTMs in this collection are jittery and/or contain large regions of missing data. These DTMs are not an improvement over lower-resolution datasets like MOLA. Those DTMs are being released for the sake of completeness. If a DTM user processes a poor DTM to a higher quality product, please let us know.",
